Package: autofilesync
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: wx3.2-i18n
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: automatic synchronisation of files and directory trees
 AutoFileSync keeps files and whole directory trees in sync, locally and
 over SSH. The graphical program autofilesync configures and runs the
 synchronisation; the systemd service backgroundsync continues it with the
 same configuration while the program is closed.
